{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13629","headline":"奉试水精环 · 严维","name":"奉试水精环","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王室符长庆，环中得水精。\n任圆循不极，见素质仍贞。\n信是天然瑞，非因朴斲成。\n无瑕胜玉美，至洁过冰清。\n未肯齐珉价，宁同杂佩声。\n能衔任黄雀，亦欲应时明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}